# Haggerty Construction

> Haggerty Construction does custom home remodels in Washington County, Utah: kitchens, bathrooms, whole-home remodels and custom cabinetry. Family-owned and disabled veteran-owned, based in St. George. Its promise is the smoothest remodel in St. George: plan it slow, build it smooth.

## About

Founded in April 2021 by William Haggerty, who spent more than 30 years in construction (from drywall to managing multi-million-dollar government projects) and served over 20 years in the National Guard. Run by William and his sons: Blake estimates and runs each project start to finish; Jayden handles the office, books and the company's own project-management software.

## How a project works

1. Free, detailed line-item estimate, usually within a few days.
2. Pre-construction: about 3% of the estimate, credited toward the build. Selections, lead times, risks, a realistic schedule and a budget dialed in close are settled before work starts.
3. Project Success Plan: scope, budget, selections and schedule in one document. The client keeps it, with no obligation to build.
4. Construction under a written contract, with changes documented, a punch list and a written list of open items at closeout.

## Services

- Kitchen Remodels: cabinets, appliances, countertops, backsplash, lighting and outlet changes, layout changes, vent hoods. Appliance layouts and cabinet openings are planned from the manufacturer specs before demo.
- Bathroom Remodels: custom tile, walk-in showers, tub-to-shower conversions, vanities, fixtures. Likely surprises behind the wall (water damage, mold) are named and priced up front.
- Whole-Home Remodels: several rooms under one plan, one schedule and one point of contact.
- Custom Cabinetry and Built-Ins: floor-to-ceiling bookcases, home offices, mudrooms, living room walls, garages and kitchen cabinet packages. Designed to the wall by the Haggertys, milled by a local manufacturer to their specs, delivered and installed by the Haggertys. The first job, in April 2021, was a floor-to-ceiling green bookcase.

## Not offered

Commercial work and cheapest-bid jobs. Open to a custom new home planned and run the same way as a remodel, though not actively marketed yet.

## Community

Blake Haggerty is an active member of Red Rock Hockey in St. George. The company has done several projects to improve the town's rinks, including a new scoreboard, and sponsors the league.

## Service Area

St. George, Washington, Hurricane, Ivins, Santa Clara, LaVerkin and Leeds: all of Washington County, Utah.

